<title>UK: Esso keeps single wet Brent cargo in chains - trad.</title>
<headline>Esso keeps single wet Brent cargo in chains - trad.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The single Brent cargo to turn wet on Wednesday was kept by Esso ahead of the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo is due to load May 15-17, they added. -- London newsroom, +44 171 542 8145</p>
